graph TB
    subgraph Client Layer
        WebClient[Web Browser - React/Next.js]
        VpnClient[OpenVPN / WireGuard Client]
    end

    subgraph Edge & Gateway
        Cloudflare[Cloudflare WAF / CDN]
        Traefik[Traefik / Nginx API & WebSocket Gateway]
    end

    subgraph Core Platform Services
        AuthSvc[Auth & IAM Service - OAuth2/JWT]
        LmsSvc[LMS & Content Engine]
        CtfSvc[CTF & KotH Game Engine]
        CertSvc[Cert & Verification Service]
        ScoreSvc[Scoreboard & Realtime Service]
    end

    subgraph Lab Orchestration & Sandbox
        LabController[Lab Orchestrator Service]
        GuacProxy[Apache Guacamole Cluster]
        VpnServer[WireGuard / OpenVPN Gateway]
        K8sCluster[K8s + KubeVirt / Firecracker Nodes]
        DockerNodes[Docker/Podman Sandbox Pool]
    end

    subgraph Data & Storage
        Postgres[(PostgreSQL - Primary DB)]
        Redis[(Redis - Cache, Pub/Sub, Queues)]
        MinIO[(MinIO / S3 - VM Images, Assets, Certs)]
    end

    WebClient --> Cloudflare --> Traefik
    VpnClient --> VpnServer

    Traefik --> AuthSvc
    Traefik --> LmsSvc
    Traefik --> CtfSvc
    Traefik --> CertSvc
    Traefik --> ScoreSvc
    Traefik --> GuacProxy

    GuacProxy -.->|Internal VNC/SSH| K8sCluster
    VpnServer -.->|Overlay Subnet| K8sCluster
    VpnServer -.->|Overlay Subnet| DockerNodes

    LabController --> K8sCluster
    LabController --> DockerNodes

    LmsSvc --> Postgres
    CtfSvc --> Redis
    ScoreSvc --> Redis
    LabController --> Redis
    CertSvc --> MinIO